The resolved values are one and the unnormalized coherent values are two. This identity retains the intermediate matter coherence: the two assignments swapping the shared old-hop destinations have the same final matter word and their field difference is the plaquette circulation. Their cross terms must not be discarded.

Let \(\rho\) be initialized in \(P_0\). With formation suppressed **only in the reference evolution**, the full Hamiltonian preserves this minimal-number sector. Its restriction is
